The '''''Mandator'' line''' was a line of [[dreadnought]]s. The ''Mandator'' line originated in the [[Standard decade|decades]] before the [[Clone Wars]]. By the time the ''[[Fulminatrix]]'' was manufactured, it was the latest of the line.<ref name="TLJ ICS" />

